This product includes software developed by the Aether Foundation
governance team (https://github.com/eneatlnc-cell/Aether) as part of
the Aether on-chain governance kernel project.

The Aether governance kernel is co-developed with the Havix network
layer under the same GitHub organization (eneatlnc-cell). Aether
provides the on-chain governance kernel on Arbitrum (three-chamber
councils, soulbound-identity ranks, Safe multisig treasury); Havix
provides the off-chain P2P coordination plane.

